---
/* Slot for the official BBB Accredited Business seal. Paste BBB's seal code here once Shield is accredited. */
---
<div class="bbb" data-bbb-seal><b>BBB accredited</b><span>Official seal goes here</span></div>
<style is:global>
.bbb{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;min-width:160px;height:54px;padding:0 16px;border:1px dashed var(--seam-2);border-radius:14px;font-size:.75rem;line-height:1.35;color:var(--ink-3)}
.bbb b{font-size:.875rem;font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}
</style>
